*> Acceptance test of docs/protocol/34-entity-models-9-non-living-entities.md section 3.2 through the renderer: the minecart rows of CLMODELS draw the five cuboids of 3.1 (180 vertices) posed as the submit says (shift of the entity id,
*> Y rotation, Z rotation by the pitch, translate 0.375, scale (-1, -1, 1)); the extent of the vertices is computed by gen/rt9.py from the document's part table; the hurt tilt of entries 8 to 10 and its fall by 1 a tick.
